{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"h":0.017831541303336418,"w":0.11920920054117834,"y":0.039049345452312645,"c":1,"t":"Introduction","x":0.80897856174287297},{"x":0.090349079763106729,"c":1,"w":0.32238192240397134,"h":0.014582046576305796,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?","y":0.088662790902340083},{"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language","x":0.086180604601546709,"h":0.018729294295859567,"y":0.12386341119790345,"w":0.83791061401367184,"c":1},{"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,","x":0.088245515980726552,"w":0.80299397786458337,"c":1,"h":0.019463204352904939,"y":0.14189386123122982},{"x":0.088295675352568798,"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All","y":0.16133720941802165,"h":0.015988371857499684,"w":0.80903493245442715,"c":1},{"x":0.088196027242723768,"h":0.02178599939937087,"y":0.17594454091412515,"w":0.83800333658854176,"t":"scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,","c":1},{"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","x":0.08624229906198129,"y":0.19764011795266212,"w":0.78028747558593758,"c":1,"h":0.016022672625066292},{"w":0.83572891235351554,"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English-language ability of a candidate classified at","c":1,"x":0.086242320440285306,"h":0.017535329498020946,"y":0.21356932142057716},{"x":0.086169818863604683,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","y":0.23176109479285445,"w":0.66544667561848958,"h":0.018264934798609134,"c":1},{"y":0.27894900158210945,"t":"9 Expert user - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate","c":1,"h":0.019205328567189817,"w":0.81325561523437517,"x":0.086185226470369775},{"t":"and fluent with complete understanding.","y":0.29714101983443664,"w":0.36378606160481775,"c":1,"h":0.018084153594520536,"x":0.13332861758582329},{"w":0.81324824015299479,"t":"Very good user - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","x":0.10671941351248374,"h":0.019447695751809158,"c":1,"y":0.32404565619609149},{"h":0.01890220867145731,"x":0.13347024028918214,"y":0.34156976775012349,"c":1,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in","w":0.7268993631998697},{"w":0.60985626220703126,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","x":0.13347022608624495,"y":0.36191860476609983,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1},{"x":0.086242300234729272,"w":0.016427103678385416,"h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.3880813954128427,"t":"7","c":1},{"y":0.389534883744173,"h":0.017544762152837734,"t":"Good user - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","x":0.13347021713471208,"w":0.72895278930664054,"c":1},{"y":0.40697674420726071,"w":0.74743326822916667,"h":0.017507031533570472,"c":1,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","x":0.13347022403830086},{"x":0.13338496328451943,"c":1,"y":0.42408464318860184,"w":0.62029535929361979,"h":0.01783764481896144,"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning."},{"h":0.011627906191665538,"c":1,"t":"6","y":0.45203488396812075,"w":0.012320328553517654,"x":0.088295687827963973},{"w":0.75154001871744802,"c":1,"y":0.45339233017172598,"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"Competent user - Has generally effective command of the language despite some","x":0.13347023693561966},{"x":0.13135990768902731,"w":0.7660231526692709,"h":0.020423004690524715,"c":1,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","y":0.46822300685730456},{"c":1,"y":0.48837209304345186,"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","h":0.017527611769054485,"w":0.46611907958984372,"x":0.13347023420510623},{"h":0.011627906191665427,"x":0.088295687797163139,"w":0.012320328553517654,"c":1,"y":0.51598837236928363,"t":"5"},{"c":1,"w":0.74765040079752598,"x":0.12926230313616363,"h":0.019985243985786494,"y":0.51451850771972729,"t":"Modest user - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning"},{"t":"in most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle","y":0.53480825980713576,"c":1,"h":0.01606383309603443,"x":0.13141683010025779,"w":0.76180699666341134},{"h":0.014749262536873142,"t":"basic communication in own field.","y":0.55073746293207293,"c":1,"x":0.13347023255604379,"w":0.30390141805013021},{"y":0.5784883721812536,"w":0.018480493227640782,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"4","x":0.084188911411504738,"c":1},{"h":0.018508862745796995,"c":1,"y":0.57784684315591939,"w":0.72704310099283853,"t":"Limited user - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent","x":0.11697193931294236},{"w":0.73321085611979175,"h":0.018459778057087095,"t":"problems in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","x":0.1292994272512191,"y":0.59662553248640604,"c":1},{"x":0.11492546427293035,"y":0.62431453374589374,"c":1,"t":"Extremely limited user - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very","w":0.76193791707356762,"h":0.018328302096476623},{"x":0.12928410550453842,"w":0.59565190633138021,"c":1,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","y":0.6422797018313251,"h":0.017532615324037271},{"h":0.017699115044247815,"w":0.78850102742513017,"c":1,"t":"2 Intermittent user - Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","y":0.66991150439128089,"x":0.08624229918926915},{"y":0.69723685151772874,"w":0.77220865885416667,"t":"1 Non-user - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few","h":0.018900465613621131,"c":1,"x":0.086173452688482824},{"w":0.14636478424072266,"x":0.12502058939729746,"t":"isolated words.","y":0.71502061504199532,"h":0.016205127682306086,"c":1},{"y":0.74418604662626697,"x":0.084188910601835781,"h":0.015990944246275229,"c":1,"t":"0 Did not attempt the test - Did not answer the questions.","w":0.56878850301106776},{"y":0.91860465143905101,"w":0.012320328553517612,"x":0.90759753584644443,"t":"7","h":0.011627906191665538,"c":1}]}